{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n《女神配對計劃 2》中陳星妤 Yvette與李爾晨 Kyle一段長達11年的「友達以上」關係，近日掀起全城熱話！Yvette因「收兵」是非纏身，竟在活動上戲稱Kyle為「兵王」，沒想到此舉竟引爆Kyle一連兩次超深情的「愛的宣言」，令全場起哄！監製Manho更即場加碼爆料，指Kyle當日聽完Yvette心意後，竟大受衝擊當場「Hang機」半日！\n</p>\n<h2>陳星妤戲稱李爾晨「兵王」 竟引出11年幸福宣言</h2>\n<p>活動期間，被問到「收兵」是非的Yvette，大方地將矛頭指向身旁的11年知己李爾晨 Kyle，笑稱他才是「兵王」。Kyle隨即「接招」，先是強調自己沒有做過任何「兵之行為」，下一秒卻畫風突變，對著Yvette發表「愛的宣言」，震撼全場！Kyle深情地說：「其實我覺得有 Yvette 喺身邊係一件好幸福嘅事，因為大家有啲咩事，都會搵對方傾訴，我覺得未必個個人都有（可以真心傾訴嘅對象），我有陳星妤。」這番話引來全場尖叫歡呼。</p>\n<h2>阿Bob追問下再爆深情告白 李爾晨：呢個決定太重要</h2>\n<p>眼見氣氛高漲，主持人阿Bob立即追問Kyle，為何當日Yvette在節目中表露心意時，他沒有立即衝出去有所表示。Kyle面露尷尬，再度語出驚人地來了個「深情告白」，解釋自己當時的內心掙扎：「我聽完 Yvette 講（有Feel）嗰吓其實好衝擊，咁我嗰刻衝出去就代表表態喇咯，呢個決定太重要，我唔可以立亂衝出去，唔通你講完之後我話『Yes，Yvette I love you！唔可以咁。』」一席話盡顯他對這段關係的重視與矛盾。</p>\n<h2>監製篤爆李爾晨Hang機半日 預告節目將解開謎團</h2>\n<p>Kyle的真情流露，連監製Manho也忍不住出手「篤爆」！Manho笑指Kyle當日聽完Yvette的告白後，整個人大受衝擊，足足「Hang機」半日，無法正常思考。Manho笑言：「你依家咁問佢，佢又要 Hang Hang 機架喇。」這番幕後爆料讓現場氣氛再度推向高峰。對於二人關係的最終走向，Manho則大賣關子，僅預告：「呢個謎節目會解開。」留給觀眾無限懸念。</p>\n<h2>網民洗版勁肉緊：快啲一齊啦</h2>\n<p>Kyle兩度真情告白，引來網民洗版式討論，紛紛表示極度「肉緊」。網民留言：「11年朋友！呢啲先係真愛！Kyle快啲表白啦！」、「Hang機半日也太可愛了吧！證明佢真係好上心！」、「Yes, Yvette I love you! 講啦！我幫你講！」、「友達以上，戀人未滿，最虐心但又最甜！」、「好期待節目點樣解開個謎，一定要追睇！」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02_11862904736af3fd977fded.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02_11862904736af3fd977fded.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/04_21399401266af3fd9f04029.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/04_21399401266af3fd9f04029.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/07_18688578976af3fdab04ad0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/07_18688578976af3fdab04ad0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/08_19060027216af3fdaf009d8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/08_19060027216af3fdaf009d8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09_18271902886af3fdb34629b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09_18271902886af3fdb34629b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_2933330346af3fdb6ef137.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_2933330346af3fdb6ef137.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T09:56:09.433050+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1317,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T09:34:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T10:30:04.360886+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T09:49:30.604537+00:00","content_hash":"286120711d242d32457bd84678989fd1e7627a0b9c459a469937fcba890490dd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}